[{"id":"cover","title":"树表查找：怎样既有序，又能高效更新？","section":null,"role":"cover","body":"<style>\n.deck .d017{--d17:#175c90;--d17muted:#506b7e}\n.deck .d017 p{font-size:clamp(21px,1.7vw,27px);line-height:1.4;margin:7px 0}\n.deck .d017 .d17-lead{font-size:clamp(25px,2.05vw,33px);font-weight:650;line-height:1.4;color:#204e73;margin:6px 0 16px}\n.deck .d017 .d17-cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:19px;align-items:stretch}\n.deck .d017 .d17-cols>*{min-width:0}\n.deck .d017 .d17-panel{background:#f5f9fd;border:1.5px solid #b9cede;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 15px;min-width:0}\n.deck .d017 .d17-panel h3{font-size:clamp(20px,1.6vw,26px);margin:1px 0 7px;color:#225b84}\n.deck .d017 .d17-note{font-size:clamp(17px,1.3vw,21px);line-height:1.4;color:#536c80;margin:5px 0}\n.deck .d017 .d17-tree{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;max-height:335px;margin:auto}\n.deck .d017 .d17-tree.long{max-height:400px}\n.deck .d017 .d17-tree.small{max-height:290px}\n.deck .d017 .d17-question{font-size:clamp(26px,2.18vw,34px);line-height:1.4;font-weight:760;border-left:6px solid #246c9d;background:#eaf3fb;padding:12px 16px;margin:14px 0}\n.deck .d017 .d17-reason{font-size:clamp(22px,1.75vw,27px);line-height:1.42;background:#eaf3fb;border-left:5px solid #236ea2;padding:12px 15px;margin:12px 0}\n.deck .d017 .d17-code{white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:clamp(18px,1.4vw,22px);line-height:1.36;background:#f0f6fb;border:1px solid #c5d9e7;border-radius:9px;padding:12px 14px}\n.deck .d017 .d17-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:clamp(20px,1.55vw,24px);line-height:1.4}\n.deck .d017 .d17-table th,.deck .d017 .d17-table td{padding:8px 11px;text-align:left;border:1px solid #bdcedc}\n.deck .d017 .d17-table th{background:#e6f1fb;color:#22577e}\n.deck .d017 .d17-array{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,minmax(0,1fr));gap:7px;margin:8px 0}\n.deck .d017 .d17-cell{border:1.5px solid #aec7db;background:#ecf5fc;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;padding:10px 2px}\n.deck .d017 .d17-cell span{display:block;color:#59768b;font-size:clamp(16px,1.18vw,19px)}\n.deck .d017 .d17-cell strong{display:block;color:#1d557f;font-size:clamp(28px,2.35vw,38px)}\n.deck .d017 .d17-workspace{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.12fr) minmax(0,.88fr);align-items:center;gap:17px}\n.deck .d017 .d17-workspace .course-prompt{font-size:clamp(24px,1.85vw,29px);line-height:1.42;font-weight:750;border-left:6px solid #2872a2;background:#eaf4fc;padding:12px 15px}\n.deck .d017 .d17-workspace .course-prompt p{font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:5px 0}\n.deck .d017 .d17-workspace .course-answer summary{font-size:clamp(20px,1.5vw,24px)}\n.deck .d017 .d17-workspace .course-solution p{font-size:clamp(19px,1.48vw,23px);line-height:1.4}\n.deck .d017 .d17-workspace.course-workspace-stacked{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n.deck .d017 .d17-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:13px;margin:13px 0}\n.deck .d017 .d17-step{border:1.5px solid #c7d8e5;background:#f2f8fd;border-radius:9px;padding:10px 13px;font-size:clamp(19px,1.48vw,23px);line-height:1.42}\n.deck .d017 .d17-step b{display:block;color:#175c90;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:clamp(20px,1.55vw,25px)}\n.deck .d017 .d17-formula{font-size:clamp(26px,2vw,33px);font-weight:700;text-align:center;background:#eaf3fb;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;margin:12px 0}\n.deck .d017 .d17-condensed .d17-tree{max-height:275px}\n.deck .d017 .d17-condensed .d17-panel{padding:9px 14px}\n.deck .d017 .d17-condensed .d17-note{margin:0}\n@media(max-width:900px){.deck .d017 .d17-cols,.deck .d017 .d17-workspace{grid-template-columns:1fr}.deck .d017 .d17-tree{max-height:270px}}\n</style><div class=\"d017\"><p class=\"d17-lead\">数据不断变化时，怎样保持有序查找的正确性，又避免搜索路径越来越长？</p><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>本讲的主问题</h3><p>从有序数组的查找与插入出发，研究用树形链接组织数据、动态维护顺序，以及如何控制不断增长的搜索路径。</p></div><p class=\"d17-note\">D017 · 数据结构与算法 · 90分钟</p></div>","goal":"提出动态有序查找与路径代价的研究问题","activity":"讲述、观察与追问","withheld_results":[]},{"id":"outline","title":"本讲沿哪些问题深入？","section":null,"role":"outline","body":"","goal":"看清顺序→树形→退化→高度→选择的认知接续","activity":"讲述、观察与追问","withheld_results":[]},{"id":"part-bridge","title":"从有序信息到动态需求","section":"bridge","role":"section","body":"","goal":"回顾有序查找的依据并发现更新成本","activity":"小节转折","withheld_results":[]},{"id":"recall-sorted","title":"查找27：为什么能排除30及其右侧？","section":"bridge","role":"exercise","body":"<div class=\"d017\"><div class=\"course-workspace d17-workspace\" data-course-component=\"task-workspace\"><div class=\"course-input\" data-task-input><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>有序数组：目标是27</h3><div class=\"d17-array\"><div class=\"d17-cell\"><span>下标 0</span><strong>16</strong></div><div class=\"d17-cell\"><span>下标 1</span><strong>20</strong></div><div class=\"d17-cell\"><span>下标 2</span><strong>27</strong></div><div class=\"d17-cell\"><span>下标 3</span><strong>30</strong></div><div class=\"d17-cell\"><span>下标 4</span><strong>36</strong></div><div class=\"d17-cell\"><span>下标 5</span><strong>44</strong></div><div class=\"d17-cell\"><span>下标 6</span><strong>55</strong></div></div><p class=\"d17-note\">已知：编号严格升序；第一次比较的是下标3、编号30。</p></div></div><div class=\"course-task\"><div class=\"course-prompt\" data-task-prompt><div class=\"d17-question\">一次比较，为什么能排除整组位置？</div></div><details class=\"course-answer\" data-task-answer><summary>核对答案与理由</summary><div class=\"course-solution\"><p>目标27 &lt; 30，而下标3及其右侧所有编号都不小于30，所以它们不可能是目标。接下来只需在30左侧查找。</p><p>这里仅利用数组顺序性质，并不需要提前使用BST术语。</p></div></details></div></div></div>","goal":"利用有序性论证折半排除的范围","activity":"独立预测并核对","withheld_results":[]},{"id":"update-array","title":"插入25：哪些原记录要移动？","section":"bridge","role":"exercise","body":"<div class=\"d017\"><div class=\"course-workspace d17-workspace\" data-course-component=\"task-workspace\"><div class=\"course-input\" data-task-input><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>插入前：容量足够的严格升序数组</h3><div class=\"d17-array\"><div class=\"d17-cell\"><span>下标 0</span><strong>16</strong></div><div class=\"d17-cell\"><span>下标 1</span><strong>20</strong></div><div class=\"d17-cell\"><span>下标 2</span><strong>27</strong></div><div class=\"d17-cell\"><span>下标 3</span><strong>30</strong></div><div class=\"d17-cell\"><span>下标 4</span><strong>36</strong></div><div class=\"d17-cell\"><span>下标 5</span><strong>44</strong></div><div class=\"d17-cell\"><span>下标 6</span><strong>55</strong></div></div><p class=\"d17-note\">任务是维护顺序，不考虑内存扩容。</p></div></div><div class=\"course-task\"><div class=\"course-prompt\" data-task-prompt><div class=\"d17-question\">将25插入时，哪些已有编号必须向右移动？</div></div><details class=\"course-answer\" data-task-answer><summary>核对答案与理由</summary><div class=\"course-solution\"><p>原有编号<b>27、30、36、44、55</b>各向右移动一位，再写入25。</p><p>新数组：16、20、25、27、30、36、44、55。定位位置与移动记录是两种不同的成本。</p></div></details></div></div><p class=\"d17-note\">有没有无需移动整段原记录的数据组织方式？</p></div>","goal":"发现有序数组中间插入需要移动的记录","activity":"先预测，再核对","withheld_results":["原有编号27、30、36、44、55"]}]